\par\par \uc2 Most Improved Colleges 2026\par \b \uc2 Commerce  Fast mover in commerce  Atma Ram Sanatan Dharma College\b0\par\par\uc2 Avishek G. Dastidar \par \uc2 372 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 July 2026\par \uc2 India Today\par \uc2 INTY\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026. Living Media India Ltd \par \par \uc2 Entrepreneurship modules, student-run consultancy and innovation power ARSD College's forward march\par \par \uc2 Over the years, the laurels showered on Atma Ram Sanatan Dharma (ARSD) College were often linked to its Commerce department, which was regarded as one of the finest in \uc2 Delhi University\uc2 . But ARSD, it appears, is just getting started. The college, located on a sprawling campus in Dhaula Kuan, has launched a Centre of Excellence for Emerging and Advanced Technologies in 2026, offering exposure to \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2 , data analytics and cyber security.\par \par \uc2 Commerce, however, continues to be ARSD's flagship discipline and has added to its sharp edge. In accordance with the National Education Policy 2020, the department launched its Fourth Year Undergraduate Programme (FYUP), which has seen many students selecting advanced study options such as dissertations, academic projects and an Entrepreneurship Track. A product of the last one went on to start an innovative beverage business from the classroom\u8212\'20\'14the JUN. In fact, ARSD was among the first institutions to implement the NEP 2020 guidelines and had introduced the four-year programme with research and entrepreneurship streams before many others. ARSD College principal Prof. Gyantosh Kumar Jha says postgraduate enrolments in MCom programmes are growing at a consistent rate.\par \par \uc2 Then there is the 180 Degrees Consulting Branch, the commerce department's student-run industry consultancy, which has finished 25 projects and industry reports. The college has introduced the 'Principal ARSD Internship Scheme (PAIS)' and the department has created a research-to-revenue pipeline.\par \par \uc2 In addition, a new Undergraduate Research and Innovation Programme now supports student-led interdisciplinary projects that are mentored by faculty members and include an element of entrepreneurship in their design. ARSD has rolled out three popular certificate courses: Forensic Science and Criminal Investigation; Theatre Techniques and Data Analysis and \b \highlight22\uc2 Artificial Intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ARSD's rise in the rankings is notable: from No. 12 in 2022 to No. 7 in 2026, making it the most improved college in commerce. The college has an NAAC A++ grade with a CGPA of 3.77, among the highest among universities. "It is a place of excellence and opportunity," says Prof. Jha.\par \par \uc2 Document INTY000020260629em760000w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw117\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1755\pichgoal600
