\par\par \uc2 Best Colleges of India 2026\par \b \uc2 Commerce  A century of academic distinction  Shri Ram College of Commerce\b0\par\par\uc2 Sonali Acharjee \par \uc2 380 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 July 2026\par \uc2 India Today\par \uc2 INTY\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026. Living Media India Ltd \par \par \uc2 In its centenary year, SRCC continues to set high standards for commerce education through increasing focus on emerging technology, as well as research and an unparalled alumni network\par \par \uc2 Students walking into Shri Ram College of Commerce (SRCC) this year will join at a significant moment\u8212\'20\'14established in 1926, the college is celebrating its centenary, marking 100 years of being one of India's top commerce and economics institutions. Alongside the year-long celebrations, students will encounter a campus that is changing in response to wider shifts in higher education.\par \par \uc2 Much of that change is being driven by the National Education Policy (NEP) 2020 and the Undergraduate Curriculum Framework (UGCF), which encourage students to study beyond the boundaries of their degree programmes. A commerce student, for instance, can now take courses in, say, Psychology, Environmental Studies or Entrepreneurship. "The spirit of NEP 2020 is encouraging Indian higher education to move from asking 'What should students know?' to asking 'What kind of individuals should students become?'" says Simrit Kaur, principal of SRCC.\par \par \uc2 Research is another focus area, with colleges increasingly encouraging students to participate in research projects, policy studies and field-based investigations. SRCC has strengthened its student research journal, Strides, while its Business Analyst Journal was recently included in the Australian Business Deans Council's 2025 Journal Quality List.\par \par \uc2 Technology is becoming more visible as well. The college is investing in smart classrooms and emerging technologies. One initiative planned for 2026-27 is a one-year programme with professional services firm \uc2 EY\uc2 , focused on \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  and its applications in industry.\par \par \uc2 Outside academics, student life at SRCC is enlivened by its many societies and events. These spaces provide opportunities for leadership, teamwork, public speaking and entrepreneurship that complement classroom learning. Through its alumni network, which connects over 20,000 people across the world, students are able to interact with professionals from a wide range of fields. Alumni talks, podcasts and networking events are a regular feature of campus life.\par \par \uc2 Students arriving in 2026 will be entering an institution with a century of history, but one that is also experimenting with new ways of teaching, learning and preparing students for a rapidly evolving world.\par \par \uc2 Document INTY000020260629em7600007\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw117\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1755\pichgoal600
